  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">一款專為<strong>包開發者</strong>設計的<strong>Minecraft</strong>模組，可透過&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a>輕鬆修改戰利品表與戰利品修飾器。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">適用於 1.21+ 版本的模組僅支援<strong>NeoForge</strong>！<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">1.21 版本的維基請見<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.almostreliable.com%252flootjs%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">較舊版本請使用<a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/lootjs/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">舊版維基</a>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>連結</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/lootjs-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 說明頁</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fThFnwZCyYY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
